# Per-machine node state (`stage`, referral code, counters) that `increment_search()` rewrites
# on every successful local search. Ignored here since 2026-08, but it stayed **tracked** until
# 2026-09-21 because .gitignore does not apply to files already in the index — so every search
# dirtied the working tree and every `git add -A` committed someone's counters. See #1991.
misakanet/profile.json
misakanet/.quota.json
*.pyo
venv/
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/

